\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, to Thee we fly,
\par On Thee for help rely;
\par Thou our only refuge art,
\par Thou dost all our fears control,
\par Rest of every troubled heart,
\par Life of every dying soul.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We lift our joyful eyes,
\par And see the dazzling prize,
\par See the purchase of Thy blood,
\par Freely now to sinners given;
\par Thou the living way hast showed,
\par Thou to us hast opened heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We now, divinely bold,
\par Of Thy reward lay hold;
\par All Thy glorious joy is ours,
\par All the treasures of Thy love;
\par Now we taste the heavenly powers,
\par Now we reign with Thee above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our anchor sure and fast
\par Within the veil is cast;
\par Stands our never-failing hope
\par Grounded in the holy place;
\par We shall after Thee mount up,
\par See the Godhead face to face.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

